From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:57:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep derived child lists only on box nodes

Text, comment and shadow-root nodes never own layout or paint child
lists. Keep those independently borrowed lists in storage that only box
nodes allocate, and read them through node accessors. On wasm32 this
shrinks Node from 68 to 52 bytes and its slot from 72 to 56 bytes.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
